<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>bake shop</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">kuala</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">bake shop</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">2KU7CB4GA26r0VQ47Lvf9i</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>03:32.000</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:01.680" end="00:06.320" ttm:agent="v1">If you want me, why don't you come hold me so tightly?</p>
      <p begin="00:06.320" end="00:10.050" ttm:agent="v1">I've been waiting for your kisses nightly</p>
      <p begin="00:10.050" end="00:12.220" ttm:agent="v1">If you're free at seven</p>
      <p begin="00:12.220" end="00:16.420" ttm:agent="v1">Can I come sneak around behind your place?</p>
      <p begin="00:16.420" end="00:20.760" ttm:agent="v1">I've been keeping track of all the things I have to do</p>
      <p begin="00:20.760" end="00:24.570" ttm:agent="v1">To maybe earn an extra smile from you</p>
      <p begin="00:24.570" end="00:26.550" ttm:agent="v1">Fingers intertwined</p>
      <p begin="00:26.550" end="00:33.020" ttm:agent="v1">Thinking 'bout how unfair it is that you live in my mind</p>
      <p begin="00:33.020" end="00:37.980" ttm:agent="v1">I've been spending my free time in the shops nearby</p>
      <p begin="00:37.980" end="00:41.820" ttm:agent="v1">At the bakery I always stop by</p>
      <p begin="00:41.820" end="00:47.700" ttm:agent="v1">But really, I'm only planning for two</p>
      <p begin="00:47.700" end="00:50.830" ttm:agent="v1">Saving for when the time is right</p>
      <p begin="00:50.830" end="00:52.720" ttm:agent="v1">We'll buy stupid things</p>
      <p begin="00:52.720" end="00:56.770" ttm:agent="v1">Share expensive drinks under the moonlight</p>
      <p begin="00:56.770" end="01:01.030" ttm:agent="v1">I promise I'll go everywhere with you</p>
      <p begin="01:01.030" end="01:08.390" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:08.390" end="01:12.000" ttm:agent="v1">Need something to do, you should come test me</p>
      <p begin="01:12.000" end="01:13.500" ttm:agent="v1">Caress me</p>
      <p begin="01:13.010" end="01:19.230" ttm:agent="v1">How long will it take before I show you just how restless I can be? Yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:19.230" end="01:22.920" ttm:agent="v1">We could go explore, I'll lead the way</p>
      <p begin="01:22.920" end="01:27.700" ttm:agent="v1">We should leave this party, we can push right through the crowd</p>
      <p begin="01:27.700" end="01:31.490" ttm:agent="v1">After all, you'll have more room to spin me around</p>
      <p begin="01:31.490" end="01:35.360" ttm:agent="v1">And I love the sound of your laughter mixing with mine</p>
      <p begin="01:35.360" end="01:39.660" ttm:agent="v1">As we wander through town</p>
      <p begin="01:39.660" end="01:44.840" ttm:agent="v1">I've been spending my free time in the shops nearby</p>
      <p begin="01:44.840" end="01:48.720" ttm:agent="v1">At the bakery I always stop by</p>
      <p begin="01:48.720" end="01:54.580" ttm:agent="v1">But really, I'm only planning for two</p>
      <p begin="01:54.580" end="01:57.620" ttm:agent="v1">Saving for when the time is right</p>
      <p begin="01:57.620" end="01:59.520" ttm:agent="v1">We'll buy stupid things</p>
      <p begin="01:59.520" end="02:03.440" ttm:agent="v1">Share expensive drinks under the moonlight</p>
      <p begin="02:03.440" end="02:07.630" ttm:agent="v1">I promise I'll go everywhere with you</p>
      <p begin="02:07.630" end="02:15.630" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:15.940" end="02:20.110" ttm:agent="v1">I want your name on my guitar so I can prove that you're mine</p>
      <p begin="02:20.110" end="02:25.850" ttm:agent="v1">Sing with me the words to your favorites, I'll know every line</p>
      <p begin="02:25.850" end="02:30.690" ttm:agent="v1">I'm staring at you as you're slowing down time</p>
      <p begin="02:30.690" end="02:34.940" ttm:agent="v1">If you could choose a place to stay while you were resting your head</p>
      <p begin="02:34.940" end="02:40.570" ttm:agent="v1">Could I beg you to say you wanna be right beside me in bed?</p>
      <p begin="02:40.570" end="02:46.050" ttm:agent="v1">Cozy up inside my arms instead</p>
      <p begin="02:46.050" end="02:51.390" ttm:agent="v1">I've been spending my free time in the shops nearby</p>
      <p begin="02:51.390" end="02:55.220" ttm:agent="v1">At the bakery I always stop by</p>
      <p begin="02:55.220" end="03:00.870" ttm:agent="v1">But really, I'm only planning for two</p>
      <p begin="03:00.870" end="03:04.170" ttm:agent="v1">Saving for when the time is right</p>
      <p begin="03:04.170" end="03:05.850" ttm:agent="v1">We'll buy stupid things</p>
      <p begin="03:05.850" end="03:09.960" ttm:agent="v1">Share expensive drinks under the moonlight</p>
      <p begin="03:09.960" end="03:15.010" ttm:agent="v1">I promise I'll go everywhere with you</p>
      <p begin="03:15.010" end="03:19.070" ttm:agent="v1">Might end up failing to remember how to spell my own name</p>
      <p begin="03:19.070" end="03:24.840" ttm:agent="v1">If you keep up the teasing that you know always drives me insane</p>
      <p begin="03:24.840" end="03:28.600" ttm:agent="v1">We'll get takeout when I take you out for the day</p>
      <p begin="03:28.600" end="03:32.600" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
